 <div class="card">
    <div class="info-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-header">
          <i data-lucide="info"></i>
          <h2>What is Accreditation Compass?</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Accreditation Compass streamlines the process of collecting, organizing, and reviewing course-level assessment data. It ensures that required materials and student competency outcomes are tracked consistently across programs.</p>
        <br>
        <div class="why-list">
          <p><i data-lucide="check"></i> Ensures programs meet accreditation requirements</p>
          <p><i data-lucide="check"></i> Tracks student competency development over time</p>
          <p><i data-lucide="check"></i> Identifies gaps in curriculum and assessment</p>
          <p><i data-lucide="check"></i> Reduces manual tracking and administrative workload</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="section-header">
          <i data-lucide="award"></i>
          <h2>Accreditation & Framework</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="framework-box">
          <h3>CAHME Accreditation</h3>
          <p>CAHME (Commission on Accreditation of Healthcare Management Education) sets national standards to ensure the quality and effectiveness of healthcare management programs.</p>
        </div>
        <br>
        <div class="framework-box">
          <h3>NCHL 3.0 Competency Model</h3>
          <p>This system uses the National Center for Healthcare Leadership (NCHL) 3.0 model to track student development across key leadership competencies required for success in healthcare management.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <div class="steps-row">
      <div class="step">
    
       <div class="step-number">1</div> 
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Faculty submit course data</strong>
          <p>Select your course, upload your syllabus and rubric, and enter teaching and assessment method details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step">
         <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-text">
           
          <strong>Download and complete the score template</strong>
          <p>A CSV template is generated with your course's primary competencies. At the end of your course enter student scores and upload it back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div> 
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Administrators review the dashboard</strong>
          <p>Track submission status, view competency score trends, and identify gaps before accreditation reporting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>